= State Elections

[+ state_news +]

@rf_state_campaign
title: An Election Next Month
subtitle: A state votes for a new Landtag next month.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: state_campaign_pending = 1
priority: 1
on-arrival: state_campaign_pending = 0

= An Election in [+ upcoming_state_name +]

[+ upcoming_state_name +] elects a new Landtag next month. The district leadership asks the Zentrale for speakers, money and the party press.

- @all_in
- @modest
- @local

@all_in
title: Throw the party into the campaign.
subtitle: Speakers from Berlin, a special edition of the paper. A strong boost here. Costs 2 resources.
choose-if: funds >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 resources.
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds -= 2;
Q['st_' + Q.upcoming_state + '_mod'] = (Q['st_' + Q.upcoming_state + '_mod'] || 0) + 3;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

The Zentrale sends its best speakers. For three weeks the party is everywhere.

@modest
title: A modest campaign.
subtitle: Some help from the centre. A small boost here. Costs 1 resource.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 resource.
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds -= 1;
Q['st_' + Q.upcoming_state + '_mod'] = (Q['st_' + Q.upcoming_state + '_mod'] || 0) + 1.5;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Leaflets, posters and a speaker for the biggest towns.

@local
title: Leave it to the local comrades.
subtitle: No cost. The local party is on its own.

The district fights the election with what it has.
